Feeling sick in France? Say THIS at the pharmacy 💊🇫🇷

• j'ai mal à la tête = I have a headache
• la gorge = the throat
• la fièvre = fever
• un comprimé = a tablet
• bon rétablissement = get well soon

💊 Save this before you travel — and comment "J'ai mal à…" to finish the sentence! 👇
💌 Save this before you travel
👯 Send it to someone who is flying to France

Small steps. Big dreams ✨

